---
import TreatmentBreadcrumb from "../../components/TreatmentBreadcrumb.astro";
import SiteMenuBehaviour from "../../components/SiteMenuBehaviour.astro";
import SiteNavigation from "../../components/SiteNavigation.astro";
import { TREATMENT_PAGES, PROVIDER, DIRECTIONS_URL, BOOKING_URL, WHATSAPP_URL } from "../../data/site";
const path = "/treatments/caci-facials-fareham/";
const title = "CACI Facials & Jowl Lift in Fareham | Forever Young Beauty";
const description = "Interested in CACI facials or a targeted Jowl Lift? Explore facial toning with Layla near Fareham, Locks Heath and Whiteley. Book on Treatwell or ask on WhatsApp.";
const canonical = "https://foreveryoungbeautybylayla.co.uk/treatments/caci-facials-fareham/";
const booking = BOOKING_URL;
const schema = {"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Service","name":"CACI Non-Surgical Facials in Fareham","description":description,"url":canonical,"provider":PROVIDER,"areaServed":[{"@type":"Place","name":"Fareham, Hampshire"},{"@type":"Place","name":"Locks Heath, Hampshire"},{"@type":"Place","name":"Park Gate, Hampshire"},{"@type":"Place","name":"Titchfield, Hampshire"},{"@type":"Place","name":"Whiteley, Hampshire"}]};
---
<!doctype html>
<html lang="en-GB">
<head><meta charset="utf-8"/><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1"/><title>{title}</title><meta name="description" content={description}/><link rel="canonical" href={canonical}/><meta property="og:title" content={title}/><meta property="og:description" content={description}/><meta property="og:url" content={canonical}/><meta property="og:type" content="website"/><script type="application/ld+json" set:html={JSON.stringify(schema)} /></head>
<body>
<header class="top"><a class="brand" href="/" aria-label="Forever Young Beauty homepage"><strong>Forever Young Beauty</strong><span>by Layla</span></a><a class="corner-logo" href="/" aria-label="Return to homepage"><img src="/images/fyb-wordmark-1.png" alt="Forever Young Beauty logo" width="62" height="62" loading="eager" /></a><details class="menu"><summary aria-label="Open site menu"><span class="hamburger" aria-hidden="true">☰</span></summary><SiteNavigation currentPath={path} /></details></header>
<main><TreatmentBreadcrumb name="CACI Facials in Fareham" path={path} /><section class="hero"><div class="inner"><p class="eyebrow">Forever Young Beauty by Layla · Titchfield Common</p><h1>CACI Non-Surgical Facials in Fareham</h1><p class="lead">Interested in a fresher-looking, more toned complexion? Come and explore CACI facial toning and the targeted Jowl Lift with me at Abshot Country Club in Titchfield Common, near Fareham.</p><a class="button" href={booking}>Book on Treatwell</a></div></section>
<div class="content"><section><h2>CACI facials and Jowl Lift near Fareham</h2><p>Looking for non-surgical CACI facial toning or a targeted Jowl Lift near Fareham? I'd love to welcome you to my private treatment room at Abshot Country Club in Titchfield Common. The setting is convenient for clients visiting from Locks Heath, Whiteley and Park Gate; <a href="/our-location/">see the venue, parking and directions</a>.</p><p>CACI facial treatments use microcurrent technology for facial toning, while the targeted Jowl Lift focuses on the lower face and jawline. We'll chat about what you'd like to achieve, how each option works and whether it's suitable for you. Everyone's skin is different, so results can vary.</p></section><section><h2>What is a CACI facial?</h2><p>CACI is a professional facial treatment system best known for its non-surgical facial toning options. Depending on the treatment selected, low-level microcurrent technology is used to stimulate facial muscles, helping support a firmer-looking, refreshed appearance.</p></section>
<section><h2>Why choose CACI?</h2><p>If you're hoping for a more refreshed appearance or would like to focus on facial contours and your jawline, CACI could be worth exploring. I'll explain what the treatment can realistically do and help you decide whether it's right for you.</p></section>
<section><h2>CACI Jowl Lift</h2><p>The CACI Jowl Lift is a targeted microcurrent facial-toning option focused on the lower face and jawline. It is designed for people interested in the appearance of their jawline and lower-face contours, rather than a surgical lifting procedure. Layla can explain how the appointment differs from a broader CACI facial, discuss suitability and set realistic expectations; results vary.</p></section>
<section><h2>CACI facial or CACI Jowl Lift?</h2><p>A CACI facial may involve a broader facial toning treatment, while the Jowl Lift focuses on the lower face and jawline. Not sure which one to choose? Just ask me. We can talk about the areas you'd like to focus on, and you can check the current treatment descriptions on Treatwell before booking.</p><p>If you are comparing other approaches to facial skincare, you can also read about <a href="/treatments/microneedling-fareham/">microneedling in Fareham</a> or <a href="/treatments/dermaplaning-fareham/">dermaplaning</a>. These are different treatments with different aims.</p></section>
<section><h2>Before and after your CACI appointment</h2><p>Tell Layla about any relevant health considerations, skin sensitivities or devices that could affect treatment suitability. Ask what the session involves, whether a course of appointments may be discussed, and which aftercare advice applies to your chosen service. Individual results and treatment recommendations vary.</p></section>
<section><h2>Your appointment</h2><p>We'll talk about your goals and any relevant health considerations before treatment. I'll also explain what to expect, how often appointments might be helpful and how to care for your skin afterwards.</p></section>

<section><h2>CACI facial questions</h2><h3>Is a CACI microcurrent facial the same as microneedling?</h3><p>No. CACI microcurrent facials are known for facial toning, while <a href="/treatments/microneedling-fareham/">microneedling</a> uses fine needles to create controlled micro-injuries in the skin. They involve different techniques, suitability considerations and aftercare. Ask Layla which of the treatments she offers best matches your aims.</p><h3>How many CACI sessions might I need?</h3><p><a href="https://cacibeauty.com/faqs/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">CACI's own guidance</a> describes a typical course of 10–15 treatments for facial toning, with maintenance often discussed afterwards. That is general brand guidance, not a promise of results or a fixed plan for everyone. Ask Layla which options, if any, suit your goals and circumstances.</p><h3>Where can I book a CACI facial near Fareham?</h3><p>Layla welcomes clients at Abshot Country Club, Titchfield Common, near Fareham, Locks Heath, Whiteley and Park Gate.</p><h3>What is a CACI Jowl Lift?</h3><p>It is a targeted CACI option focused on the lower face and jawline. You can compare current treatment descriptions and prices on the booking page.</p><h3>How do I check appointment availability?</h3><p>Select the booking button to view Layla’s own online booking page. You can check current treatment options, prices and appointment times before booking.</p><h3>Will results be the same for everyone?</h3><p>No. Results depend on individual circumstances, and no particular outcome can be guaranteed.</p></section>
<section class="trust"><h2>Facial treatment reviews</h2><blockquote><p>“Layla is very professional, caring and friendly. She makes sure you are comfortable and relaxed during the treatment. I will definitely be returning on a regular basis.”</p><footer>Corinne · CACI Facial · Treatwell verified review</footer></blockquote><blockquote><p>“Layla is amazing! I have had loads of facials over the years, however this was by far the best. Layla is diligent, knowledgeable and is a wonderful therapist. Thank you!”</p><footer>Maxine · Facial · Google review</footer></blockquote><blockquote><p>“Fabulous facial as always. Layla never rushes you and is very experienced.”</p><footer>Caroline · CACI Facial · Treatwell verified review</footer></blockquote><p>Read more verified customer feedback on Layla’s public Treatwell listing before choosing a treatment.</p><p><a href="https://www.treatwell.co.uk/place/forever-young-beauty-by-layla/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Read verified Treatwell reviews →</a></p></section>
<section class="contact"><h2>Book your CACI facial or Jowl Lift</h2><p>Explore Layla’s current CACI treatments and appointment availability on Treatwell.</p><p>Appointments take place at Abshot Country Club, Little Abshot Road, Titchfield Common, Fareham, Hampshire PO14 4LN. Layla welcomes clients from Fareham, Locks Heath, Park Gate, Warsash, Stubbington and nearby Whiteley.</p><p>Not sure which treatment is right for you? Layla can discuss your skincare goals and treatment suitability.</p><a class="button" href={booking}>Book on Treatwell</a><div class="contact-actions"><a class="contact-action maps-action" href={DIRECTIONS_URL} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Directions on Google Maps</a><a class="contact-action whatsapp-action" href={WHATSAPP_URL} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">WhatsApp Layla</a></div></section>
<nav aria-label="Other treatments"><h2>Explore more treatments</h2><div class="links">{TREATMENT_PAGES.filter((t) => t.href !== path).map((t) => <a href={t.href}>{t.label}</a>)}</div></nav></div></main>
<footer><a href="/">Forever Young Beauty by Layla</a> · Titchfield Common, Fareham</footer>
<SiteMenuBehaviour />
<script src="/booking-tracking.js" defer></script>
</body></html>
<style>
/* Keep primary booking actions comfortably tappable on mobile. */
